The beam is centred **5.5 m into its deck**. A blocked player can hold forward, tap C to return to the landing checkpoint, then run and slide again. The **regular hand finished 20/20 seeded retries**. On seed 1, the original course timed out at 3,600 ticks. The revised course finished in 394.

| Gate | Final result |
|---|---|
| Fast | **PASS** · 244/244 units, 5/5 steps |
| Full packs/world | **PASS** · 34/34 pack verb runs, 8/8 world hashes matched |
| Parkour bots | **PASS** · 4/4, including all three original tests |
| Impossibility | **PASS** · both probes rejected the 12 m gap as expected |

Changed `course.gd`, `main.gd`, `pack.json` and `README.md`. Added `yard.json` and the regular-hand retry bot. The course reuses KIT.md’s `scaffold`, `ground_patch`, `kerb` and `flag`. The yard uses `crane`, `cabin`, `tree`, `tyre_stack`, `lumber`, `pallet` and `barricade`. All changes are uncommitted and confined to the pack and lane evidence.

